Package: shipwright
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, git
Maintainer: shipwright contributors <oluwatoyosi.abolaji25@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/abj360/shipwright
Description: Terminal coding agent that runs inside a gVisor sandbox
 shipwright opens a terminal interface on one directory and lets an agent read
 and change it. The agent only ever runs inside a gVisor-isolated container
 that mounts the directory you opened, and nothing above it.
 .
 gVisor (runsc) is required and is not in the Debian or Ubuntu archives, so it
 is not listed as a dependency. Install it from gvisor.dev before running ship.
